<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities arrested an alleged Jalisco cartel leader known as R2 in Zapopan and seized a cell linked to the CJNG, while a mayor who had been abducted was recovered alive after hours. Mexican police helicopters fired on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7-year-old American girl. Villagers who were kidnapped for weeks described how cartels now dominate rural communities, extending control beyond urban areas. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNc3d2VFhsUzJucjhiOHdzTnBuU0VDNF9PcEV3c2VvQ2FlQ3lZM2k5VXF3TXlseFJaMDlkekVxT19GUHJvbG1VdHdfbmNRWi1MdU9zdXpGVjJCSkhXc0NOSXVseldlXzZvOU1NVlJmaFlqNUlkUkJFeHFPZ2ZIRjNkdE5vb2Ixd01LVGttWEluTTNnakkybGVtMlFfM2VHcGVqbzBFbWJWWDNFcWVTSmJGWFdmRWlVVG9tS3hpcmVtQ3Jpd04yRmdKeg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOWThMV3duekNmc2hvb0pZWXNCV1ZJNlRBTExMZk05N2dkcXVZR05qWk04d09PSHNkVHhuWWRLckZEZVlndEpPcEE5SlAybllBMm5aR0U5NWx2ZnFUVTdaYzFfaWs0MUtQT2tuenF4TFdKR08zQS1Zb0FHSzdhaHdVeUFNMUFfeUtxZ2kwZ1VwbTV3XzNCZkV4QmhvVzJjdG9USjdsaE9UMHhtMWNSY3ZveGZCbHhBODZX0gG-AUFVX3lxTE0yb01VMUJTd0EwTkI3Z2piQm1TZmhFOHlsOXI4aE00VmgwOUNkY1N4b3pEYjBoYWM1NXB2eWY4a1FYeFgwZ1Aya1k4c04zbVV3TTMyUERmV2JfVFZ5aUg1SHBKcWptMVdaQlJKZE9Oenp5ZnVUYkZRb2s5WkdDYUd6aUItTmp0QUZfaWFBZnlYX0FFODdDVVA1QzBldHVmcS1WSmxqSEVIbjBvazRrY2lIU1lrcm40Sk5OUGJCUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsNation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPWXZ4YW1raE9DRldhZjZSTjREMmY2S19HbUd0d25uSUY4aFpjbWZyenNIc3NpX1lwVmpzZ19zS2